### The Breeder's Guide

A decision-oriented companion for breeders, quantitative geneticists, trial
managers, and reviewers. It explains the scientific assumptions, environmental
evidence branches, common-treatment and seed decisions, allocation strategies,
local field designs, robustness analyses, and deployment checks without
requiring the reader to follow R code.

📘 **[Download the OptiSparseMET Breeder's Guide (PDF)](https://github.com/FAkohoue/OptiSparseMET/raw/master/inst/guides/OptiSparseMET_Breeders_Guide.pdf)**

